    "id": "AAS_4158_POA_ANNUA_Ecology_1",
    "stac_version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "This data set contains data on the ecology of Poa annua on Macquarie Island collected over a 3 year period. It contains information on the longevity of plants (Longevity), morphology of the plants and how plants allocate biomass to the different plant components (Biomass) and vegetation surveys describing the plant communities Poa annua inhabits. The sites used in this study were distributed across an altitudinal and Poa annua density gradient and are described in the spread sheet (study sites)",
